#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Potret pasuryan sampeyan sing Ubuntu Hello mbandhingake. Tansah paling ora "
"loro, direkam ing cahya sing beda."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Nuduhake model sing disimpen kanggo:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Mung siji model pasuryan sing didaftar. Cahya ngganti tampilan pasuryan "
"sampeyan menyang kamera, dadi model siji bisa gagal ing wayah sore ing "
"ngisor lampu (utawa ing wayah awan). Tambah model kapindho sing direkam ing "
"cahya sing beda-beda supaya bisa mbukak kunci sing bisa dipercaya kapan wae."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tambah model kapindho"

#: src/main.ui:222
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Model"

#: src/main.ui:255
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "kamera"

#: src/main.ui:269
msgid ""
"The camera Ubuntu Hello uses to look for your face, with a live preview."
msgstr ""
"Kamera Ubuntu Hello digunakake kanggo nggoleki pasuryan sampeyan, kanthi "
"pratinjau langsung."

