msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Kabar"

#: src/main.ui:435
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Kabar desktop ditampilake nalika Ubuntu Hello nggoleki pasuryan sampeyan, "
"banjur lapor asile. Usaha sing gagal tetep ana ing dhaptar kabar."

#: src/main.ui:466
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Tampilake kabar"

#: src/main.ui:472
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Siji kertu saben nyoba bukti asli pasuryan, dianyari ing panggonan karo asil."

#: src/main.ui:503
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Swara kabar"

#: src/main.ui:509
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Puter swara sistem kanggo nyoba dikenali utawa gagal."

#: src/main.ui:540
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Kalebu diagnostik"

#: src/main.ui:546
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Tambah model, kepastian vs batesan, pigura, kamera lan wektu kanggo saben "
"kertu. Migunani nalika nglaporake masalah."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Otomatis Mbukak Kunci"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake otentikasi pasuryan supaya otomatis mbukak kunci kunci mlebu utawa "
"KWallet nalika mlebu. Iki kanthi aman nyimpen tembung sandhi sing disegel "
"ing TPM yen kasedhiya, utawa dienkripsi nganggo AES-256-GCM nggunakake kunci "
"master mung root. Setelan autentikasi pasuryan PAM_AUTHTOK kanggo "
"pam_gnome_keyring utawa pam_kwallet5 gumantung ing desktop sampeyan."

